WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.320
If your prep is MiraLAX, this video will walk you through exactly how to take

2
00:00:03.320 --> 00:00:03.920
it.

3
00:00:03.920 --> 00:00:06.480
Just follow along step by step.

4
00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:10.540
For this prep, you'll need a few items, all available over the counter, no

5
00:00:10.540 --> 00:00:11.900
prescription needed.

6
00:00:11.900 --> 00:00:16.820
You'll need one 238-gram bottle of MiraLAX powder, two to four Dulcolax laxative

7
00:00:16.820 --> 00:00:17.200
tablets

8
00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:21.720
and 64 ounces of a clear sports drink like Gatorade, Propel, or Crystal Light.

9
00:00:21.720 --> 00:00:23.560
That's usually two 32-ounce bottles.

10
00:00:23.560 --> 00:00:27.440
If you have diabetes, use sugar-free Gatorade G2.

11
00:00:27.440 --> 00:00:31.240
Also, make sure you get the laxative tablets, not the stool softener.

12
00:00:31.240 --> 00:00:35.360
One important rule, your sports drink cannot be red, orange, blue, or purple.

13
00:00:35.360 --> 00:00:38.600
Stick to clear or light-colored flavors.

14
00:00:38.600 --> 00:00:42.720
The day before your colonoscopy, you'll start by mixing the solution.

15
00:00:42.720 --> 00:00:47.390
Pour the entire bottle of MiraLAX into a pitcher with all 64 ounces of the

16
00:00:47.390 --> 00:00:48.640
sports drink.

17
00:00:48.640 --> 00:00:52.360
Stir or shake until the powder is completely dissolved.

18
00:00:52.360 --> 00:00:56.420
You can chill it in the refrigerator if you'd like, keeping it cold makes it

19
00:00:56.420 --> 00:00:57.800
easier to drink.

20
00:00:57.800 --> 00:01:01.680
Now for part one, the evening before your procedure.

21
00:01:01.680 --> 00:01:05.800
At 4pm, take your Dulcolax tablets with a glass of water.

22
00:01:05.800 --> 00:01:09.800
Your doctor's instructions will tell you whether to take two or four.

23
00:01:09.800 --> 00:01:12.360
Follow their guidance on the specific amount.

24
00:01:12.360 --> 00:01:17.760
At 5pm, you'll start drinking the first half of the solution, that's 32 ounces.

25
00:01:17.760 --> 00:01:22.040
Drink an 8 ounce glass every 15 minutes until that half is gone.

26
00:01:22.040 --> 00:01:24.760
Keep drinking clear liquids after you finish.

27
00:01:24.760 --> 00:01:28.880
For part two, six hours before your colonoscopy, you'll drink the second half

28
00:01:28.880 --> 00:01:29.640
which is another

29
00:01:29.640 --> 00:01:31.400
32 ounces.

30
00:01:31.400 --> 00:01:36.160
Drink this at the same pace, an 8 ounce glass every 15 minutes.

31
00:01:36.160 --> 00:01:40.520
You can continue to have clear liquids up until four hours before your

32
00:01:40.520 --> 00:01:41.480
procedure.

33
00:01:41.480 --> 00:01:43.200
This part is really important.

34
00:01:43.200 --> 00:01:47.160
You must drink all of the prep solution as directed, even if you're already

35
00:01:47.160 --> 00:01:47.560
passing clear

36
00:01:47.560 --> 00:01:48.560
liquid.

37
00:01:48.560 --> 00:01:51.850
I know it can feel like enough, but finishing the entire dose is what gives us

38
00:01:51.850 --> 00:01:52.480
the clearest

39
00:01:52.480 --> 00:01:54.400
view during your procedure.

40
00:01:54.400 --> 00:01:57.960
If the prep isn't completed as directed, we may need to reschedule, and neither

41
00:01:57.960 --> 00:01:58.360
of us

42
00:01:58.360 --> 00:01:59.920
wants that.

43
00:01:59.920 --> 00:02:04.240
Please drink plenty of liquids throughout the process to prevent dehydration.

44
00:02:04.240 --> 00:02:07.920
Staying hydrated will help you feel better and help the prep do its job.

45
00:02:07.920 --> 00:02:10.960
If you experience any discomfort from frequent trips to the bathroom, applying

46
00:02:10.960 --> 00:02:11.800
a petroleum-based

47
00:02:11.800 --> 00:02:15.080
ointment or diaper rash cream can really help.

48
00:02:15.080 --> 00:02:16.080
That's it.

49
00:02:16.080 --> 00:02:17.640
You've got this.

50
00:02:17.640 --> 00:02:20.560
Follow the timing, finish the full dose and stay hydrated.

51
00:02:20.560 --> 00:02:23.880
If you have any questions at all, don't hesitate to call our office.

52
00:02:23.880 --> 00:02:24.320
We're here to help.
